{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：新IP首次与GitHub仓库交互。对应需求：执行。官方：First Occurrence of GitHub Repo Interaction From a New IP。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-github.audit-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：新IP首次与GitHub仓库交互","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"0294f105-d7af-4a02-ae90-35f56763ffa2","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"event.dataset:\"github.audit\" and event.category:\"configuration\" and\ngithub.actor_ip:* and github.repo:* and \ngithub.repository_public:false\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1648","name":"Serverless Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1648/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1213","name":"Data from Information Repositories","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1213/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1213.003","name":"Code Repositories","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1213/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.004","name":"Cloud Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["github.repo","github.actor_ip"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"github","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：新IP首次与GitHub仓库交互\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":209,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
